SIGMA:     5
DYAD_Q1:   LUX_ATG (quintile 1, pre_trade=0.4635, mean_theta=0.8554)
DYAD_Q5:   NLD_CRI (quintile 5, pre_trade=1946.6291, mean_theta=-0.0583)
ARMS:      lo(SD=0.74), hi(SD=1.48)
SCENARIO:  Conditional GE (Y, E held at data values)
GATE:      G1_plumbing [PASS]
GATE:      G2_market_clearing [PASS]
GATE:      G3_convergence [PASS]
GATE:      G4_arm_monotonicity [PASS]
